doc/startup_procedure.md                    | Startup / onboarding procedure for the project — how to get the system running from scratch
libcloud.rest/REST_API_REFERENCE.md         | REST API reference documentation for the libcloud component — endpoints, request/response schemas
lldap/ARCHITECTURE.md                       | Architecture overview for the LDAP (lldap) component — design decisions, component layout
lldap/README.md                             | Primary readme / entry point for the LDAP component
lldap/lldap.md                              | Detailed LDAP configuration or usage documentation
openfga_my/ARCHITECTURE.md                  | Architecture overview for the OpenFGA authorization component
openfga_my/IDENTITY.md                      | Identity / authentication model — how users, groups, and tenants are represented
openfga_my/authorization.md                 | Authorization model — FGA relationship tuples, authorization patterns
openfga_my/how_to_add_new_tenant.md         | Step-by-step guide for provisioning a new tenant in the OpenFGA system
openfga_my/lessons_learned.md               | Retrospective / post-mortem notes — pitfalls, gotchas, and design lessons from building OpenFGA
openfga_my/privilege.md                     | Privilege / permission definitions — what actions each role can perform
openfga_my/privilege0.md                    | Likely a base/seed privilege configuration or a revision of privilege.md
openfga_my/prompt.md                        | Prompt / CLI interaction guide for the OpenFGA component
openfga_my/rest_api_security.md             | Security considerations for the REST API — authn, authz, threat model
openfga_my/security_bug.md                  | Documented security bug / vulnerability — reproduction, impact, and remediation
openfga_my/system_flow.md                   | End-to-end system flow diagrams or descriptions — how requests traverse the system
openfga_my/table.md                         | Table definitions — database schema, FGA store layout, or relationship tables
openfga_my/user.md                          | User model documentation — user lifecycle, attributes, provisioning
stoplight_mock/ARCHITECTURE.md              | Architecture overview for the Stoplight mock API component — how mock servers are structured
